[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0010","text":"──大家辛苦了\n我买了切好的西瓜回来补充水分"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0020","text":"谢谢──！／谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0030","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0040","text":"──路加\n自主练习辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0050","text":"……………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0056","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0060","text":"慰问的西瓜放在冰箱里了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0070","text":"…………哈？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0080","text":"……刚才，你没吃……\n西瓜很好吃哦？其实路加你也想吃西瓜──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0090","text":"谁要吃啊──\n这么喜欢的话你自己吃个够"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32600600_02_0100","text":"这个西瓜混蛋────……"}]
